    "role": "user",
    "content": "{\n  \"manuscript_guide\": \"全文按\\\"临床关联证据—免疫机制—代谢物中介—外部干扰—主动干预—毒性管理—方法学与转化边界\\\"推进。引言与正文最终应实际引用至少150篇去重文献；引用必须参与论证，不为凑数机械平分到各章，也不把尚未写出的引言预先计入已完成指标。来源别名应统一处理：P0333与P0584、P0402与P0576、P0049与P0605等视为同一来源，避免重复计数；工具或检索导航标识不得充当正文文献编号。全篇反复出现的核心对象必须有明确主讲位置：Ch1负责观察性关联强度、队列异质性、方案修饰和证据阶梯入口；Ch2负责免疫机制链条并严格区分动物因果与人类关联；Ch3负责代谢物分子靶点、情境依赖和TME浓度缺口；Ch4负责抗生素、PPI、饮食和生活方式等外部暴露的时机、剂量、癌种背景与因果边界；Ch5负责FMT、定义菌群和活体生物药的临床转化、疗效异质性与证据等级；Ch6负责毒性预测、疗效/毒性耦合或解耦、供体与方案情境化安全管理；Ch7负责把前述瓶颈转为方法学设计原则。跨章承接要具体：Ch1让读者理解关联存在但不可普适，留下机制解释和干预验证问题；Ch2解释微生物如何进入先天和适应性免疫，但不解决代谢物浓度与外部扰动问题；Ch3把机制落到化学介质和受体通路，留下血浆与TME暴露脱节的问题；Ch4说明临床现实中的暴露如何重塑这些轴，留下主动干预是否可行；Ch5评估主动干预的疗效与边界，留下毒性管理问题；Ch6处理疗效与毒性如何耦合或解耦，留下预测和标准化难题；Ch7归纳为可执行研究设计。写作中不得使用同一种\\\"背景→机制→应用→局限\\\"模板套所有对象，也不得在每章结尾重复同一句证据不足。比较必须先明确维度：癌种、ICI方案、暴露时窗、基线/纵向、供体特征、宿主免疫状态、模型系统与人体证据、血浆/粪便与TME浓度。对可能性、条件性和阴性结果要保留原有限定：观察性关联不写成因果，动物模型不直接外推人类，血浆浓度不等同组织浓度，Phase II信号不写成Phase III确证，特定癌种或方案的结果不扩大为普适结论。关于P0593：该来源实际内容为别嘌醇通过嘌呤补救途径增加肌苷分泌、增强肿瘤免疫原性的机制研究（小鼠CT26模型+人类膀胱癌回顾性队列），并非TACITO试验。正文中不得将P0593作为TACITO d-FMT联合ICI治疗mRCC的来源引用。P0593应在Ch3肌苷部分作为非微生物来源肌苷增效的平行机制证据使用，或在Ch5作为非菌群代谢干预的对比案例。mRCC中FMT联合ICI的随机证据应引用P0090系统综述中汇总的Phase II RCT数据（FMT联合pembrolizumab+axitinib，1年PFS 66.7% vs 35.0%）。\\n\\n全文章节写作安排：\\n\\nCh1 — 实体瘤中肠道微生物组与 ICI 疗效的临床关联证据\\n本章先建立\\\"有信号但无通用标志物\\\"的判断，再解释为何不能外推。顺序为：跨癌种阳性信号与反例 → 队列异质性与功能趋同 → 治疗方案修饰 → 外部药物暴露作为修饰变量 → 基线快照局限与纵向动态 → 证据阶梯表。跨队列统计、肠型、SCRUM-Japan、mCRPC反例和菌株级方案依赖共同支撑无普适标志物；JCOG2007在此主讲方案特异性，后章只回指。抗生素和PPI只保留总体效应量、关键时间窗和校正必要，详细剂量反应、HCC阴性、PPI机制留给Ch4。FMT-LUMINate、MIMic、MITRIC在表中只保留阶段、人群、主要结局和关键限制，机制与试验比较留给Ch5。本章结尾应留下两个问题：这些关联通过什么免疫机制表达，以及主动干预能否跨越观察性关联。\\n\\nCh2 — 微生物调节 ICI 疗效的免疫学机制\\n本章以机制链条组织，不按菌种罗列。顺序为：先天识别与DC启动 → 适应性启动与T细胞亚群 → 屏障、易位与髓系重编程 → 肿瘤类型和模型差异。每个节点都要区分证据层级：小鼠或体外因果、人类宏基因组或伴随观察、肿瘤内微生物边界。六酰化LPS、CD103+ DC、PD-L2/RGMb主讲先天和DC启动；分子模拟主讲适应性启动；P0098的Treg动态只作短回指，主要免疫中介留给Ch6。屏障部分要说明屏障损伤与疗效增强可以分离，细菌易位要区分主动免疫转运与被动漏肠，髓系部分要说明同一易位信号可产生促炎或抑制后果。最后用表格比较肿瘤类型机制与证据类型，不重复Ch1的临床关联强度。\\n\\nCh3 — 微生物代谢物的中介作用与分子机制\\n本章按分子靶点和情境条件组织代谢物，不按来源菌列表。先写SCFAs的双向性：PD-1背景下增强CD8+ T细胞和记忆，CTLA-4背景下可能促Treg或抑制DC共刺激；再写缺氧、葡萄糖剥夺和浓度阈值造成的效应反转。肌苷部分必须分开两条机制：肿瘤内在UBA6抑制与T细胞A2AR或碳源作用；临床只保留血浆关联和早期随机信号，并明确人体TME实测浓度缺失。胆汁酸与色氨酸代谢物围绕TGR5/FXR、AhR/RORγt等受体网络写局部与系统差异。功能通路部分由Ch2回指，但主讲放在本章，用于说明功能特征优于分类学。最后的TME浓度缺口要具体说明其阻碍剂量优化、因果推断和临床给药设计。P0593（别嘌醇/肌苷研究）在本章作为非微生物来源肌苷增效的平行证据使用：别嘌醇通过抑制XDH增加肌苷分泌→上调MHC-I和PD-L1→增强CD8+ T细胞杀伤，在CT26模型中联合抗PD-1实现4/6完全清除，人类膀胱癌回顾性队列（n=50）中抗痛风药使用者OS显著优于未使用者。此案例说明肌苷通路可被非菌群手段激活，但不能替代菌群来源肌苷的生理浓度讨论；其人类证据仅为小样本回顾性关联，不升级为因果。\\n\\nCh4 — 外部因素对微生物 - 免疫轴的干扰\\n本章主讲外部暴露如何改变微生物-免疫轴，并与Ch1的修饰变量概览分工：Ch1只给出效应量和时间窗入口，本章展开时机、剂量、药物类别、肿瘤背景和因果边界。抗生素按时间窗和疗程组织，加入HCC阴性结果与PD-L1分层，防止单一负面模型。PPI部分从流行病学关联转到口腔化易位、多样性下降和近期化疗修饰，并用H2B对照提出降级建议。饮食和生活方式部分区分食物基质、定义菌株补充剂和非标准化益生菌，避免把益生菌统一写成有益或有害。所有推断都要标注观察性证据和适应症偏倚，不能把药物暴露与疗效下降直接写成菌群因果链。\\n\\nCh5 — 微生物干预策略的临床转化现状\\n本章是主动干预的临床转化主轴。顺序为：初治人群信号 → 耐药人群边界 → 定义菌群和活体生物药 → 安全性边界 → 证据等级与标准化。FMT-LUMINate的疗效与\\\"有害菌丢失而非供体定植\\\"机制在此主讲；MIMic的定植动力学和生存数据也在此展开；MITRIC主讲阴性原因。Ch1的证据阶梯表只作为入口，本章不重复列表式介绍，而解释异质性来源。关于mRCC中FMT联合ICI的随机证据：细纲原将TACITO数据归于P0593，但P0593实际内容为别嘌醇/肌苷机制研究，不包含TACITO试验数据。本章mRCC FMT随机证据应引用P0090系统综述中汇总的Phase II RCT数据：FMT联合pembrolizumab+axitinib，1年PFS 66.7% vs 35.0%（p=0.036），ORR 54% vs 28%，未增加≥3级不良事件。此数据来自会议摘要级别的II期RCT，应标注证据等级为早期随机、小样本。不得在正文中引用不存在的TACITO具体数值（如12个月PFS 70% vs 41%、中位PFS 24.0 vs 9.0个月、P=0.053），除非后续获得独立来源确认。安全性部分与Ch6分工：本章保留干预安全边界和试验设计含义，毒性预测、耦合或解耦和管理策略留给Ch6。\\n\\nCh6 — 微生物组与免疫治疗毒性的关联\\n本章从毒性表型出发，不按药物列表。顺序为：结肠炎最强证据与因果验证 → 器官特异性和预测模型困境 → 疗效与毒性耦合或解耦 → 干预相关毒性的情境依赖 → 分子机制。Ch5已讲干预疗效与总体安全边界，本章新增的是毒性预测标志物、供体-方案交互和管理含义。FMT-LUMINate的Cluster B、Prevotella和Segatella copri数据在此主讲毒性情境，不再重述完整试验设计；P0284的屏障和代谢双重机制只保留与毒性相关的部分，详细机制回指Ch2。非结肠炎毒性必须明确样本量不足，不能把结肠炎结论外推到心肌炎或神经毒性。\\n\\nCh7 — 方法学挑战与未来研究方向\\n本章不是再次总结各章局限，而是把瓶颈转为可操作设计原则。顺序为：技术与标准化 → 观察性因果推断 → 临床证据与人群表征 → 未来方法。技术部分用标准化重分析和培养组学说明噪音与真实信号并存；因果部分强调反向因果、药物、饮食、年龄等混杂和孟德尔随机化边界；临床部分强调Phase III缺席、年龄、儿科、种族和TME浓度缺口；未来部分提出功能导向、多组学、AI、类器官或芯片和供体制剂标准化。引用应服务设计原则，不重复前文具体数值，也不把每个已知缺口写成全文唯一主线。\",\n  \"chapter_assignment\": {\n    \"chapter_id\": \"Ch1\",\n    \"title\": \"实体瘤中肠道微生物组与 ICI 疗效的临床关联证据\",\n    \"writing_arrangement\": \"本章先建立\\\"有信号但无通用标志物\\\"的判断，再解释为何不能外推。顺序为：跨癌种阳性信号与反例 → 队列异质性与功能趋同 → 治疗方案修饰 → 外部药物暴露作为修饰变量 → 基线快照局限与纵向动态 → 证据阶梯表。跨队列统计、肠型、SCRUM-Japan、mCRPC反例和菌株级方案依赖共同支撑无普适标志物；JCOG2007在此主讲方案特异性，后章只回指。抗生素和PPI只保留总体效应量、关键时间窗和校正必要，详细剂量反应、HCC阴性、PPI机制留给Ch4。FMT-LUMINate、MIMic、MITRIC在表中只保留阶段、人群、主要结局和关键限制，机制与试验比较留给Ch5。本章结尾应留下两个问题：这些关联通过什么免疫机制表达，以及主动干预能否跨越观察性关联。\",\n    \"required_content\": [\n      \"保留证据阶梯表：试验或阶段、目标人群、干预策略、主要疗效结果、关键局限；至少包括FMT-LUMINate、MITRIC、MIMic、早期FMT或益生菌综述及干预策略对比。\",\n      \"写出队列本身是微生物组成变异的重要解释因素，并给出跨队列泛化能力差的具体依据，不能只泛称异质性。\",\n      \"保留反例：mCRPC中Akkermansia muciniphila负相关、SCRUM-Japan中整体α多样性不关联及口腔细菌比例升高与PPI的交互。\",\n      \"保留治疗方案修饰：NIC与PC背景下Fusicatenibacter、Butyricicoccus和Prevotellaceae NK3B31的相反风险方向。\",\n      \"保留抗生素和PPI的关键效应量与时间窗，但不展开长疗程剂量反应、HCC缓冲机制或PPI口腔化机制。\",\n      \"明确当前缺乏Phase III RCT，且安全性信号受ICI方案调节；此处只作为转化边界，不展开毒性机制。\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"materials\": {\n    \"schema_version\": \"optomind.guided_body_materials.v1\",\n    \"evidence_atoms\": [\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::497bb7e33f801930e98c5290\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1abfd42410ea8cfac727c93b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\",\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::81a434e6c7c8a99518e1508c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用叙事性综述方法，综合分析了近年来关于NSCLC患者微生物组与ICI反应关联的临床研究、回顾性队列分析以及动物模型实验。重点比较了响应者与无响应者的微生物组成差异，分析了抗生素使用对预后的影响机制，并汇总了正在进行的或已完成的涉及FMT、益生菌、饮食等干预措施的临床试验结果。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\",\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f0b377715bad283896abfe1e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了NSCLC患者微生物组特征与ICI疗效关联的最新证据汇总，明确了关键的保护性和风险性菌属。\",\n          \"limits\": \"作为综述，其结论依赖于所引用的原始研究，这些研究多为回顾性或单中心小规模试验，存在地理偏倚（主要来自中国和日本）和方法学异质性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\",\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ee4d72056c99bec83f9087b8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"详细阐述了抗生素和PPI对ICI疗效的负面干扰机制，为临床合理用药提供依据。\",\n          \"limits\": \"对于微生物组调节的具体分子机制（如抗原特异性与非特异性机制的细节）尚未完全阐明，文中指出“大部分机制仍未知”。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\",\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f6d378b9f95e97eb1941761d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"评估了FMT、MET、益生菌、饮食等多种干预策略的临床转化潜力。\",\n          \"limits\": \"大多数微生物组干预措施仍处于早期临床试验阶段，缺乏针对NSCLC的大规模随机对照试验结果，长期安全性和有效性尚不确定。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\",\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c769007484209b19fef83328\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"接受抗PD-1/PD-L1治疗的NSCLC患者\",\n          \"finding\": \"特定细菌丰度与疗效相关：A. muciniphila、Ruminococcus、Faecalibacterium、Blautia等通常与良好预后相关；而Parabacteroides、Fusobacterium、Hungatella等则与耐药相关。值得注意的是，A. muciniphila丰度过高（超过第77百分位）可能与较短的总生存期相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\",\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1d5e3fc0fe0da2736280b832\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"ICI治疗前近期使用抗生素（特别是β-内酰胺酶抑制剂、氟喹诺酮类）\",\n          \"finding\": \"抗生素使用导致肠道菌群失调，显著缩短NSCLC患者的中位总生存期（OS）和无进展生存期（PFS），且这种负面影响在ICI治疗前30天内最为明显。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\",\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4c396bd4df8d2fa702a9621c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"动物模型及初步临床试验\",\n          \"finding\": \"FMT从ICI响应者转移至小鼠可恢复ICI疗效；口服A. muciniphila可逆转耐药。部分临床试验显示FMT联合ICI在黑色素瘤和NSCLC中具有安全性和初步疗效，但针对NSCLC的大规模数据仍有限。益生菌的效果在不同研究中存在不一致性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\",\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::98d13296c90706b90522a72c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\",\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::492c6800fef6fc47aaf6ee2a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管ICI在NSCLC中取得了显著疗效，但许多患者出现原发或继发耐药及免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）。目前尚缺乏有效的预测生物标志物和克服耐药的策略。本研究旨在阐明微生物组如何影响ICI疗效，并探索基于微生物组的新型治疗途径。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\",\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e6ae378cdebe54c3509e6ded\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者，聚焦于肠道微生物组、肺部微生物组及其代谢产物与免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效及毒性的关系。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\",\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1104e373c7cd8897267cf2ff\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文是一篇综述，系统梳理了肠道和肺部微生物组作为预测生物标志物及辅助治疗策略在NSCLC免疫治疗中的应用现状。文章首先回顾了抗生素（ATB）和质子泵抑制剂（PPI）等合并用药对微生物组的破坏作用及其对ICI疗效的负面影响；其次，总结了多项临床研究中确定的与ICI响应相关的特定细菌特征（如Akkermansia muciniphila、Faecalibacterium等）；最后，评估了通过粪便微生物移植（FMT）、益生菌、益生元、饮食干预及噬菌体疗法等调节微生物组的潜在治疗手段及其临床试验进展。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\",\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::18206f6807254bace51a9dab\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这些关联主要基于观察性研究和回顾性队列，因果关系需结合机制研究确认。不同研究间的菌属定义可能存在技术差异（16S vs WGS）。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了NSCLC患者中与ICI响应和非响应相关的特定微生物特征列表。例如，响应者富集Akkermansia muciniphila, Faecalibacterium prausnitzii, Bifidobacterium spp., Blautia等；非响应者富集Parabacteroides, Fusobacterium, Hungatella等。同时指出了A. muciniphila丰度过高的潜在风险。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\",\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::853adb3bb7b26e67c353c0fb\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"许多机制细节来自小鼠模型或体外实验，直接外推到人类NSCLC患者需谨慎。作者明确指出大部分机制“仍 largely unknown”，现有解释多为假说或初步证据。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提出了几种可能的机制路径：1) 抗生素通过下调MAdCAM-1表达，促进Enterocloster增殖，进而抑制Th17/Treg细胞向肿瘤迁移；2) 某些细菌（如E. hirae）携带的噬菌体蛋白可与肿瘤抗原发生交叉反应，激活CD8+ T细胞；3) 短链脂肪酸（如丁酸）由有益菌产生，可能增强抗肿瘤免疫反应；4) 肺部微生物（如Veillonella）通过上调PI3K/Akt和ERK/MAPK通路促进肿瘤进展。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\",\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::638d4a7a3a58f532f118a819\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"多数试验处于I/II期，样本量小，且部分结果来自其他癌种（如黑色素瘤、肾细胞癌），不能直接等同于NSCLC的最终结论。益生菌效果在不同研究中存在矛盾。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"总结了当前针对NSCLC的微生物组干预临床试验（NCT编号），包括FMT、MET、益生菌（如C. butyricum, Bifidobacterium）和饮食补充剂（如Castalagin, MicrSoy-20）的进展和初步结果。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\",\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d481890c6b7976290445bc3c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"综述了从传统化疗到ICI治疗的转变，以及微生物组作为“癌症新标志物”的地位确立过程。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\",\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b14d8b0ecd2e9823eb7cca3e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"引用了多个大型队列研究，显示ATB和PPI使用显著降低OS和PFS，并讨论了时间窗和药物类别的影响。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\",\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c327beb39b31f914a870cd26\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"指出肺部微生物组（如Veillonella, Streptococcus）与肿瘤进展相关，并提示其与肠道微生物组的联系有待探索。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\",\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::305ef5f317b44253f5a4f2e1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该综述主要聚焦于NSCLC，虽然提及黑色素瘤和肾细胞癌的FMT数据，但不能直接将其结果推广到其他实体瘤或所有肺癌亚型。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\",\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::69dbf8cbd49f9262c1dd55c4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"文中提到的微生物组与疗效的关联多为相关性，因果机制大多仍在假设阶段，特别是关于具体菌株的作用机制。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\",\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::09f0ae80f008a4f415cb2b9a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"抗生素对ICI疗效的负面影响在大多数研究中得到证实，但也存在少数相反结果的报道，需注意这一争议性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\",\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6079edad177c6b833010e597\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"益生菌的效果在不同研究中不一致，部分研究显示有益，部分显示无效甚至有害，需谨慎解读其作为常规辅助治疗的潜力。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\",\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a71cbe1fa763e19351e5753b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"微生物组检测技术（16S rRNA vs WGS）和分析方法的差异可能导致不同研究间结果的不可比性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\",\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0ffa5ea057b945295c6db8aa\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-b5c2e925a4132b88eff6\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-7f937d5566b4c12030ce\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-a96686bee2f7be7a8dd8\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-724817b1ad2fa81c8182\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-ba354d40740f64366cbf\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-403bce67afb0fdb07c1f\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc\",\n          \"snapshot::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a\",\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3a56e52037504dbe5998345d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b4ed5145d05c05df30b00f09\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::89b8f947d85f7362a3c254e0\",\n          \"snapshot::448ef91485221af0125a17af\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f807fe07bfdaa7666e1c8895\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::89b8f947d85f7362a3c254e0\",\n          \"snapshot::448ef91485221af0125a17af\",\n          \"snapshot::aab188251adff198144a1cd5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a9ef548424611edfbcf54ff5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"As a narrative review, this paper does not employ a systematic search protocol described in the text. Instead, it synthesizes findings from a broad range of sources including: 1) Historical timeline analysis of key advancements; 2) Summary of clinical trial data (Tables 1-5) linking specific microbial taxa to ICI/ACT outcomes; 3) Mechanistic discussion based on preclinical models (mouse studies) and human cohort analyses regarding immune cell activation, metabolite pathways (SCFAs, bile acids, etc.), and intratumoral interactions; 4) Evaluation of intervention strategies (antibiotics, FMT, probiotics, diet, engineered microbes) by summarizing results from ongoing and completed clinical trials.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::89b8f947d85f7362a3c254e0\",\n          \"snapshot::448ef91485221af0125a17af\",\n          \"snapshot::aab188251adff198144a1cd5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5837ed0c8dbe3897ba6b01b8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"Provides a structured synthesis of clinical and preclinical evidence linking specific gut microbial taxa to ICI and ACT outcomes across multiple cancer types. It categorizes mechanisms into innate/adaptive immunity modulation, metabolite effects, and intratumoral interactions. It also catalogs numerous ongoing clinical trials for FMT, probiotics, and dietary interventions.\",\n          \"limits\": \"As a narrative review, it lacks a systematic methodology for study selection, potentially introducing selection bias. Many findings are derived from small-scale clinical studies or animal models, limiting generalizability. The field faces significant heterogeneity in sequencing methods, sample handling, and lack of standardized protocols, making cross-study comparisons difficult. Causal relationships between specific microbes and clinical outcomes are often correlational rather than proven causal.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::89b8f947d85f7362a3c254e0\",\n          \"snapshot::448ef91485221af0125a17af\",\n          \"snapshot::aab188251adff198144a1cd5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::681a92e8d7b7987be2bcbba3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"ICI therapy (anti-PD-1/PD-L1/CTLA-4)\",\n          \"finding\": \"Specific gut microbial compositions correlate with ICI response. Beneficial taxa include Bifidobacterium, Akkermansia muciniphila, Ruminococcaceae, and Faecalibacterium prausnitzii, which are associated with improved survival and tumor regression in melanoma, NSCLC, and RCC. Conversely, antibiotic use generally reduces ICI efficacy.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::89b8f947d85f7362a3c254e0\",\n          \"snapshot::448ef91485221af0125a17af\",\n          \"snapshot::aab188251adff198144a1cd5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3d86d0a6bec0c10f55a857ee\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"ACT therapy (CAR-T, TCR-T)\",\n          \"finding\": \"Gut microbiota influences ACT efficacy and toxicity. Certain microbes (e.g., Ruminococcus, Bacteroides) are linked to CAR-T efficacy, while others may predict neurotoxicity or cytokine release syndrome (CRS). Microbial metabolites like SCFAs can enhance CD8+ T cell cytotoxicity.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::89b8f947d85f7362a3c254e0\",\n          \"snapshot::448ef91485221af0125a17af\",\n          \"snapshot::aab188251adff198144a1cd5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::731c4e19c2e491a533d19ed9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Mechanisms of Immune Modulation\",\n          \"finding\": \"Microbiota modulate immunity via direct interaction with dendritic cells and macrophages (PRR activation), metabolite signaling (SCFAs, bile acids, tryptophan metabolites influencing T cell differentiation), and molecular mimicry (cross-reactive T cells). Intratumoral microbiota can remodel the TME, promoting TLS formation or inducing immunosuppression.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::89b8f947d85f7362a3c254e0\",\n          \"snapshot::448ef91485221af0125a17af\",\n          \"snapshot::aab188251adff198144a1cd5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::385abb08948f6bfd5a895cdb\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Intervention Strategies\",\n          \"finding\": \"FMT from ICI responders can overcome resistance in refractory melanoma patients. Probiotics (e.g., Clostridium butyricum CBM588) and dietary interventions (high-fiber, ketogenic) show promise in enhancing ICI response and reducing toxicity, though clinical evidence is still emerging.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::89b8f947d85f7362a3c254e0\",\n          \"snapshot::448ef91485221af0125a17af\",\n          \"snapshot::aab188251adff198144a1cd5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1022c7a0d677eea8339a07e5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::89b8f947d85f7362a3c254e0\",\n          \"snapshot::448ef91485221af0125a17af\",\n          \"snapshot::aab188251adff198144a1cd5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b948719cef3c84a90bacafe2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Despite the success of immunotherapies like ICIs and ACTs, patient responses vary widely due to primary or acquired resistance and adverse events. This review aims to elucidate the role of the gut microbiota in shaping these outcomes, identify potential biomarkers for predicting response, and explore microbiota-based strategies to enhance efficacy and mitigate toxicity.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::89b8f947d85f7362a3c254e0\",\n          \"snapshot::448ef91485221af0125a17af\",\n          \"snapshot::aab188251adff198144a1cd5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0b5c58557176e76454e9789e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The review focuses on the gut microbiota and its influence on cancer immunotherapy, specifically immune checkpoint inhibitors (ICIs) and adoptive cell therapies (ACTs). It covers clinical correlations, preclinical mechanisms, intratumoral microbiota, and intervention strategies across various solid tumors and hematologic malignancies.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::89b8f947d85f7362a3c254e0\",\n          \"snapshot::448ef91485221af0125a17af\",\n          \"snapshot::aab188251adff198144a1cd5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::00e315febc4d75be2605fe4d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"This paper provides a comprehensive overview of how the gut microbiome modulates the efficacy and toxicity of cancer immunotherapies. It traces the historical evolution from early animal studies to recent clinical trials, detailing specific microbial signatures associated with response or resistance to ICIs and ACTs. The authors synthesize mechanistic insights involving innate and adaptive immune modulation, metabolite production, and tumor microenvironment remodeling. Furthermore, it evaluates therapeutic interventions such as fecal microbiota transplantation (FMT), probiotics, dietary modifications, and engineered bacteria, while highlighting challenges in standardization and clinical translation.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::89b8f947d85f7362a3c254e0\",\n          \"snapshot::448ef91485221af0125a17af\",\n          \"snapshot::aab188251adff198144a1cd5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f0893cf07f418f00505a67b3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"Associations are largely correlative from retrospective or small prospective cohorts. Specificity varies by cancer type and ICI agent. Lack of standardized detection methods limits direct comparison. Does not establish causality.\",\n          \"contribution\": \"Identifies specific gut microbial taxa associated with ICI response or resistance in solid tumors. For example, Akkermansia muciniphila, Bifidobacterium, and Ruminococcaceae are linked to better outcomes in melanoma and NSCLC, while certain Proteobacteria or high abundance of Bacteroides intestinalis may correlate with resistance or toxicity. It also notes that beneficial taxa vary by ICI type (anti-PD-1 vs. anti-CTLA-4) and cancer type.\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::89b8f947d85f7362a3c254e0\",\n          \"snapshot::448ef91485221af0125a17af\",\n          \"snapshot::aab188251adff198144a1cd5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9acac8e7a085b376f6d5fa09\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"Many mechanisms are primarily demonstrated in mouse models (preclinical). Human validation is often indirect or observational. Some mechanisms (e.g., molecular mimicry) are proposed but require further confirmation in humans. Effects can be bidirectional (promoting or suppressing immunity depending on context).\",\n          \"contribution\": \"Details mechanisms by which gut microbiota modulate ICI efficacy: 1) Direct immune modulation via PRR activation (TLR/NLR) leading to DC maturation and T-cell activation; 2) Metabolite-mediated regulation (SCFAs inhibiting HDAC, bile acids affecting Th17/Treg balance, tryptophan metabolites via AhR); 3) Molecular mimicry where bacterial antigens cross-react with tumor antigens; 4) Remodeling of the tumor microenvironment (TME) through intratumoral bacteria or systemic metabolites influencing tertiary lymphoid structures (TLS).\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::89b8f947d85f7362a3c254e0\",\n          \"snapshot::448ef91485221af0125a17af\",\n          \"snapshot::aab188251adff198144a1cd5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a099308176c365e60e6c9707\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Historical perspective section tracing discoveries from 2007 to 2025, highlighting the shift from correlation to mechanistic understanding and clinical trials.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::89b8f947d85f7362a3c254e0\",\n          \"snapshot::448ef91485221af0125a17af\",\n          \"snapshot::aab188251adff198144a1cd5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::330df5057e74b7364a8ff13e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Sections on FMT, probiotics, antibiotics, diet, and engineered microbes, including tables of clinical trials.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::89b8f947d85f7362a3c254e0\",\n          \"snapshot::448ef91485221af0125a17af\",\n          \"snapshot::aab188251adff198144a1cd5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b6025fb0bea4f9c424e4a773\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Section on 'Challenges and future directions' discussing technical variability, donor effects in FMT, host genetics, and lack of standardization.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::89b8f947d85f7362a3c254e0\",\n          \"snapshot::448ef91485221af0125a17af\",\n          \"snapshot::aab188251adff198144a1cd5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::89f397ff3a02c8a970e8f7bb\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The review covers both gut and intratumoral microbiota; ensure distinction is maintained when applying findings to 'gut microbiome' specific facets.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::89b8f947d85f7362a3c254e0\",\n          \"snapshot::448ef91485221af0125a17af\",\n          \"snapshot::aab188251adff198144a1cd5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0d39e28531ff4eba8773e916\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Findings on specific bacterial taxa are highly dependent on the cancer type (e.g., melanoma vs. NSCLC) and the specific ICI agent (anti-PD-1 vs. anti-CTLA-4); avoid over-generalizing across all solid tumors.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::89b8f947d85f7362a3c254e0\",\n          \"snapshot::448ef91485221af0125a17af\",\n          \"snapshot::aab188251adff198144a1cd5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b893f3c804b4e30fff3fd0e6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Many mechanistic insights are derived from murine models; caution is needed when extrapolating to human physiology without explicit human validation mentioned in the text.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::89b8f947d85f7362a3c254e0\",\n          \"snapshot::448ef91485221af0125a17af\",\n          \"snapshot::aab188251adff198144a1cd5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f4b86b110a79614d126a2863\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Clinical trial data cited are often from early-phase (I/II) or small cohorts; results should not be interpreted as definitive proof of efficacy for interventions like FMT or probiotics.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::89b8f947d85f7362a3c254e0\",\n          \"snapshot::448ef91485221af0125a17af\",\n          \"snapshot::aab188251adff198144a1cd5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::02d1348f18e02c25ac2296c2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::89b8f947d85f7362a3c254e0\",\n          \"snapshot::448ef91485221af0125a17af\",\n          \"snapshot::aab188251adff198144a1cd5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a08b4d948542bbf6392b23a5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::aab188251adff198144a1cd5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ef240eea79c14842a161ea01\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"abstract\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b48b92078f04672f80082d00\",\n          \"snapshot::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6\",\n          \"snapshot::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::70aec41e07d695a8eac67632\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b48b92078f04672f80082d00\",\n          \"snapshot::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6\",\n          \"snapshot::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::68c3a7f85812b14bab2835b5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"这是一项嵌入在随机对照III期临床试验（JCOG2007, NIPPON）中的辅助生物标志物研究。研究设计包括：1. 队列选择：从入组的295名患者中筛选出270名提供基线粪便样本的患者进行分析。2. 分组比较：比较两种一线治疗方案（PC vs NIC）。3. 微生物分析：对基线粪便样本进行16S rDNA测序，进行α/β多样性分析和LEfSe差异丰度分析。4. 临床关联分析：将微生物特征（多样性、特定菌属丰度）与主要临床终点（OS超过12或18个月的亚群区分、总体OS、≥Grade 4严重不良事件发生率）进行统计学关联分析，并进行了按治疗方案的亚组分析。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b48b92078f04672f80082d00\",\n          \"snapshot::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6\",\n          \"snapshot::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::dc5ac621424e5a680d638cf3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了在大型III期临床试验背景下，肠道微生物群与NSCLC化疗-免疫治疗预后及安全性关联的具体实证数据。识别了特定的细菌属（如Fusicatenibacter, Butyricicoccus）作为潜在的预后和安全性标志物，并提示了方案特异性的微生物效应。\",\n          \"limits\": \"仅基于摘要信息，无法评估多变量校正模型的完整性、多重检验校正方法、16S测序的具体流程细节及批次效应处理。结果主要关联观察性，因果机制未阐明。NIC组中Prevotellaceae NK3B31的结果需结合具体统计显著性和置信区间解读。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b48b92078f04672f80082d00\",\n          \"snapshot::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6\",\n          \"snapshot::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1c86a89535162f292ea1f987\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"整体队列（n=270），根据OS是否超过12或18个月划分的亚群\",\n          \"finding\": \"β多样性分析显示不同生存时间亚群具有不同的微生物结构。LEfSe分析发现，Fusicatenibacter、Butyricicoccus和Blautia在长生存患者中富集。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b48b92078f04672f80082d00\",\n          \"snapshot::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6\",\n          \"snapshot::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1057b507eca51d0fcea5f768\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"整体队列，关注严重不良事件（≥ Grade 4 AEs）\",\n          \"finding\": \"较低的微生物α多样性及某些特定菌属的存在与较高的严重AE风险相关。相反，有益菌属（如Fusicatenibacter和Butyricicoccus）的高丰度与较低的严重AE风险相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b48b92078f04672f80082d00\",\n          \"snapshot::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6\",\n          \"snapshot::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d2ee193139c04a77bbb7f1c3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"按治疗方案分层（NIC臂 vs CP/PC臂）\",\n          \"finding\": \"在NIC组中，Fusicatenibacter和Butyricicoccus的高丰度与更好的OS相关（HR分别为0.56和0.52），优于CP组。而在NIC组中，Prevotellaceae NK3B31的高丰度与更高的死亡风险相关（HR=2.33）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b48b92078f04672f80082d00\",\n          \"snapshot::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6\",\n          \"snapshot::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3d1546bb5d6cbcbbdd64352c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b48b92078f04672f80082d00\",\n          \"snapshot::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6\",\n          \"snapshot::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4d32c7c4fc57964f4eca5feb\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管免疫治疗改变了NSCLC的治疗格局，但缺乏可靠的生物标志物来指导治疗选择。肠道微生物群虽被视为潜在生物标志物，但其在NSCLC化疗-免疫联合治疗中的具体作用尚不清楚。本研究试图回答：肠道微生物群的组成和多样性是否能预测晚期NSCLC患者在接受不同化疗-免疫联合方案时的预后（OS）和治疗安全性（严重AEs）？\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b48b92078f04672f80082d00\",\n          \"snapshot::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6\",\n          \"snapshot::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::11588e401bbf4877af15cff5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"针对无驱动基因改变的晚期非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者，基于JCOG2007（NIPPON）III期临床试验的辅助生物标志物研究。研究对象为接受培美曲塞+铂类化疗联合帕博利珠单抗（PC组）或纳武利尤单抗+伊匹木单抗联合铂类化疗（NIC组）的患者，分析基线粪便样本中的肠道微生物群。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b48b92078f04672f80082d00\",\n          \"snapshot::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6\",\n          \"snapshot::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::64bc295bd46b3e9847e3a952\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在探索肠道微生物群作为晚期NSCLC化疗-免疫治疗疗效和安全性生物标志物的潜力。研究利用JCOG2007试验中270名有基线粪便样本患者的16S rDNA测序数据，分析了微生物多样性及特定菌属丰度与总生存期（OS）及严重不良事件（AEs）之间的关联。结果显示，微生物结构随生存时间延长而变化，特定产丁酸菌属富集于长生存患者，且与较低的严重AE风险相关；此外，不同治疗方案下微生物对预后的影响存在差异。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b48b92078f04672f80082d00\",\n          \"snapshot::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6\",\n          \"snapshot::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3ca5c85cf380e43b5cfe3c21\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"结果来自NSCLC特定人群，且为观察性关联。NIC组中Prevotellaceae NK3B31显示负面关联，提示微生物效应具有复杂性和情境依赖性。不能直接外推至所有实体瘤或所有ICI单药治疗。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肠道微生物群与ICI疗效关联的临床队列证据。具体发现：Fusicatenibacter和Butyricicoccus的高丰度与更长的OS相关，特别是在NIC（纳武利尤单抗+伊匹木单抗）方案中效果显著（HR 0.56/0.52）。同时，这些菌属也与较低的严重AE风险相关。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b48b92078f04672f80082d00\",\n          \"snapshot::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6\",\n          \"snapshot::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::64d85960adb517ce19d05f9c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"本研究未提供直接的机制验证（如动物模型、体外实验或代谢产物测量）。关联不等于因果。方案特异性结果的生物学解释需谨慎，可能涉及药物代谢、免疫微环境改变等多重因素。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了微生物群落结构与临床结局（生存期和毒性）的关联数据，暗示了微生物可能通过调节宿主免疫反应（进而影响疗效和毒性）发挥作用，但未直接测定分子机制。指出了不同免疫检查点阻断策略（PD-1 vs CTLA-4+PD-1）下微生物效应的差异性（方案特异性）。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b48b92078f04672f80082d00\",\n          \"snapshot::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6\",\n          \"snapshot::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fe193bdc0e2868dc90b9e8c9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"研究背景指出免疫治疗改变了NSCLC治疗格局，但缺乏可靠生物标志物，肠道微生物群被视为潜在标志物。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b48b92078f04672f80082d00\",\n          \"snapshot::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6\",\n          \"snapshot::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c6d8c3fa05acba612e1717fa\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"NIC组中Prevotellaceae NK3B31高丰度与高死亡风险（HR=2.33）相关，而Fusicatenibacter等则有益。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b48b92078f04672f80082d00\",\n          \"snapshot::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6\",\n          \"snapshot::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3b2e0449447121ab035839cf\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"结论建议将肠道微生物谱分析整合到临床实践中以优化一线治疗策略。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b48b92078f04672f80082d00\",\n          \"snapshot::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6\",\n          \"snapshot::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1cedc9d5eb5f2f3606fcdc9a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究为观察性附属研究，关联结果不能直接推断因果关系。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b48b92078f04672f80082d00\",\n          \"snapshot::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6\",\n          \"snapshot::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bf4fe4efa643acabaa4c1e7d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"结果基于16S rDNA测序，分辨率限于属水平，且未提供功能基因组或代谢组数据，机制解释受限。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b48b92078f04672f80082d00\",\n          \"snapshot::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6\",\n          \"snapshot::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::97b487409f4caf96753a443e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"NIC组中Prevotellaceae NK3B31的负面结果需警惕，可能与样本量、统计效力或特定亚群特征有关，不宜简单概括为该类菌普遍有害。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b48b92078f04672f80082d00\",\n          \"snapshot::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6\",\n          \"snapshot::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1f2b75a988619767a272f17b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"方案特异性结果（NIC vs PC）的差异可能受药物相互作用、患者基线特征或其他混杂因素影响，需谨慎解读。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b48b92078f04672f80082d00\",\n          \"snapshot::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6\",\n          \"snapshot::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6dfb0494d7ff39f7b74ab413\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"摘要未提供详细的统计校正方法（如多重检验校正、协变量调整），影响结果的确信度评估。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b48b92078f04672f80082d00\",\n          \"snapshot::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6\",\n          \"snapshot::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::66a42283328586c4e93ab1e9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"supplement_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"auxiliary_material\": \"The study highlights regimen-specific effects, noting that microbial associations with outcomes differed between the PD-1 inhibitor-based regimen (PC) and the dual checkpoint blockade regimen (NIC). It identifies specific bacterial genera (Fusicatenibacter, Butyricicoccus, Blautia) enriched in patients with longer OS (>12 or >18 months). It also notes that lower microbial alpha diversity and presence of certain taxa were linked to a higher risk of serious (≥ Grade 4) AEs. The authors conclude that gut microbiota may serve as a biomarker for chemo-immunotherapy in advanced NSCLC.\",\n          \"evidence\": [],\n          \"gap_id\": \"case_E_phase3_rct\",\n          \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\progressive_review_plan\\\\20260926_adaptive_retrieval\\\\03_external_closure\\\\runs\\\\case_E_phase3_rct\\\\source_units\\\\SU03_search_candidate_3636101ad7\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n          \"limitations\": [],\n          \"material_ready\": true,\n          \"material_usefulness\": \"direct\",\n          \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n          \"remaining_gap\": \"\",\n          \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n          \"status\": \"fulfilled\",\n          \"useful_material\": \"This study reports on the JCOG2007 trial, a completed phase III randomized controlled trial comparing pembrolizumab plus platinum doublet chemotherapy (PC) and nivolumab-ipilimumab plus platinum doublet chemotherapy (NIC) in treatment-naïve advanced non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC) patients. The trial enrolled 295 patients, with an ancillary biomarker analysis performed on baseline fecal samples from 270 patients using 16S rDNA sequencing. The study found that gut microbiota composition was associated with overall survival (OS) and adverse events (AEs). Specifically, higher abundance of Fusicatenibacter and Butyricicoccus was linked to better OS in the NIC arm compared to the PC arm, and these genera were also associated with a lower risk of serious AEs. Conversely, higher abundance of Prevotellaceae NK3B31 was associated with higher mortality risk in the NIC arm.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b48b92078f04672f80082d00\",\n          \"snapshot::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6\",\n          \"snapshot::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::420263f1f2804510d71b896a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"supplement_materials\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": [\n          {\n            \"auxiliary_material\": \"The study highlights regimen-specific effects, noting that microbial associations with outcomes differed between the PD-1 inhibitor-based regimen (PC) and the dual checkpoint blockade regimen (NIC). It identifies specific bacterial genera (Fusicatenibacter, Butyricicoccus, Blautia) enriched in patients with longer OS (>12 or >18 months). It also notes that lower microbial alpha diversity and presence of certain taxa were linked to a higher risk of serious (≥ Grade 4) AEs. The authors conclude that gut microbiota may serve as a biomarker for chemo-immunotherapy in advanced NSCLC.\",\n            \"evidence\": [],\n            \"gap_id\": \"case_E_phase3_rct\",\n            \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\progressive_review_plan\\\\20260926_adaptive_retrieval\\\\03_external_closure\\\\runs\\\\case_E_phase3_rct\\\\source_units\\\\SU03_search_candidate_3636101ad7\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n            \"limitations\": [],\n            \"material_ready\": true,\n            \"material_usefulness\": \"direct\",\n            \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"remaining_gap\": \"\",\n            \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"status\": \"fulfilled\",\n            \"useful_material\": \"This study reports on the JCOG2007 trial, a completed phase III randomized controlled trial comparing pembrolizumab plus platinum doublet chemotherapy (PC) and nivolumab-ipilimumab plus platinum doublet chemotherapy (NIC) in treatment-naïve advanced non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC) patients. The trial enrolled 295 patients, with an ancillary biomarker analysis performed on baseline fecal samples from 270 patients using 16S rDNA sequencing. The study found that gut microbiota composition was associated with overall survival (OS) and adverse events (AEs). Specifically, higher abundance of Fusicatenibacter and Butyricicoccus was linked to better OS in the NIC arm compared to the PC arm, and these genera were also associated with a lower risk of serious AEs. Conversely, higher abundance of Prevotellaceae NK3B31 was associated with higher mortality risk in the NIC arm.\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b48b92078f04672f80082d00\",\n          \"snapshot::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6\",\n          \"snapshot::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5f53fd31bc8e45bdb2ad45d7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"identity\",\n              \"reason\": \"source identity was not independently verified\",\n              \"status\": \"input_attributed\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"no complete research body was indexed\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"html\",\n              \"reason\": \"html_empty\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"html\",\n              \"reason\": \"html_challenge_or_login\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"only abstract or non-title snippets were available\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"abstract_only\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b48b92078f04672f80082d00\",\n          \"snapshot::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6\",\n          \"snapshot::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c68a4a095d1c9891c04ffbfd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7aa9765c310a4edb019e2a72\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::43d1d2d99f218db8b718a352\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用系统综述和荟萃分析方法。文献检索涵盖PubMed, Embase, Web of Science, Scopus。纳入标准为成人NSCLC或黑色素瘤患者，接受ICI治疗，有基线肠道微生物组数据（16S rRNA或宏基因组测序），并报告OS, PFS, ORR或irAEs。数据提取后，对α多样性、特定菌属丰度、抗生素使用等暴露因素进行荟萃分析，使用DerSimonian and Laird随机效应模型合并HR和OR。进行亚组分析（癌症类型、测序方法）。使用NOS评估研究质量，使用GRADE评估证据确定性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c4d309ac1cde98d6b8709654\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了关于肠道微生物组特征（多样性、特定菌属）与NSCLC和黑色素瘤患者ICI疗效及安全性之间关联的综合定量证据。确认了高多样性、Akkermansia、Faecalibacterium的有益关联以及抗生素使用的有害关联。区分了不同ICI类型（抗CTLA-4 vs. 抗PD-1）在irAEs方面的不同微生物关联。\",\n          \"limits\": \"纳入的研究均为观察性研究，无法确立因果关系。证据确定性被评定为“中等”，主要因研究设计的观察性质和部分结果的不一致性。由于原始数据不可用，无法进行个体参与者数据（IPD）分析，限制了更精细的混杂因素调整。术语上只能界定为“预后”关联，难以严格区分“预测”价值。对于抗PD-1/PD-L1治疗相关的irAEs，因数据异质性过大，未能进行荟萃分析。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d84296b388152c7979fd950b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"基线高肠道微生物α多样性 vs. 低多样性\",\n          \"finding\": \"显著改善OS (pooled HR 0.52, 95% CI 0.41–0.66) 和 PFS (pooled HR 0.58, 95% CI 0.47–0.71)。在NSCLC和黑色素瘤亚组中均稳健，且不受测序方法（16S vs. 宏基因组）影响。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cdc81546840364f19d0aba86\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"基线存在 Akkermansia\",\n          \"finding\": \"显著增加客观缓解率 (ORR) (pooled OR 2.15, 95% CI 1.38–3.35)。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::beb916d15aaaf5246d1c96ef\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"基线高丰度 Faecalibacterium\",\n          \"finding\": \"显著改善无进展生存期 (PFS) (pooled HR 0.68, 95% CI 0.54–0.85)。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::26c01767d4685cb0f8134920\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"ICI治疗前1-2个月内使用抗生素\",\n          \"finding\": \"显著恶化总生存期 (OS) (pooled HR 1.72, 95% CI 1.34–2.21)。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7ad25bf2a1ba9d152dfac164\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"黑色素瘤患者接受抗CTLA-4治疗，基线高丰度 Bacteroidetes\",\n          \"finding\": \"显著降低严重（≥3级）结肠炎风险 (pooled OR 0.34, 95% CI 0.18–0.64)。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c5201dbfec7444fabe6d46d4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"黑色素瘤患者接受抗CTLA-4治疗，基线高丰度 Bacteroides intestinalis\",\n          \"finding\": \"一项研究提示与严重毒性风险增加相关（未纳入荟萃分析）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6845e52863a124bc3a9e9d76\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a08db013f727c78ff312974e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管已有证据表明肠道微生物组影响ICI疗效，但现有证据碎片化且存在不一致。本研究旨在定量综合基线肠道微生物组特征（多样性和特定菌属）与NSCLC和黑色素瘤患者ICI临床结局（生存、响应、不良反应）之间的关联，并评估证据质量，以明确其作为预后生物标志物的潜力。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2657dddf7ff0503a09b0066f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）和黑色素瘤患者；接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs，包括抗PD-1/PD-L1或抗CTLA-4治疗）；基线肠道微生物组特征与临床结局（OS, PFS, ORR, irAEs）的关联。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::603e93a0db245ce5d5043b75\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究是一项系统综述和荟萃分析，旨在综合评估基线肠道微生物组特征与非小细胞肺癌和黑色素瘤患者免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效及安全性之间的预后关联。研究遵循PRISMA指南，检索了截至2025年4月的多项数据库，纳入26项涉及1,542名患者的观察性研究。通过随机效应模型汇总了风险比（HR）和比值比（OR），并使用GRADE框架评估证据质量。结果显示，高肠道微生物α多样性与改善的总生存期和无进展生存期显著相关；特定菌属（如Akkermansia、Faecalibacterium）的存在与更好的客观缓解率或无进展生存期相关；近期抗生素使用与较差的生存结果相关；而在接受抗CTLA-4治疗的黑色素瘤患者中，拟杆菌门的高丰度与严重结肠炎风险降低相关。整体证据确定性为中等。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::341ba0c9574f1673cb38b262\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅证明预后关联，不证明因果调节。证据等级为中等。主要针对NSCLC和黑色素瘤，外推至其他实体瘤需谨慎。对于irAEs，仅针对抗CTLA-4诱导的结肠炎有定量证据，其他irAEs证据不足。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肠道微生物组特征（高α多样性、Akkermansia存在、Faecalibacterium高丰度）与ICI疗效（OS, PFS, ORR）改善之间的定量关联证据（HR/OR值）。提供了抗生素使用与疗效下降关联的证据。提供了特定微生物特征（Bacteroidetes高丰度）与特定irAEs（抗CTLA-4诱导的结肠炎）风险降低的关联证据。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::137033c39710bdf4608c64d5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这些是作者基于现有文献提出的机制假说，并非本荟萃分析直接验证的机制。本综述本身不提供新的机制实验数据。机制解释具有推测性，需结合其他基础研究论文进行验证。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"在讨论部分提出了可能的机制解释：Akkermansia可能通过增强肿瘤微环境中CD4+和CD8+ T细胞的招募和激活来增强PD-1阻断疗效；Faecalibacterium作为丁酸盐的主要生产者，可能通过支持肠道屏障完整性和抗炎特性发挥作用；抗生素的有害影响可能与耗竭这些有益细菌有关。还提到了功能趋同的概念（如短链脂肪酸、次级胆汁酸代谢）。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a8d6e80eb7d375ce3e7325a1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"指出传统生物标志物（PD-L1, TMB）预测准确性有限，凸显寻找新生物标志物的需求。回顾了2018年两项开创性临床研究（Gopalakrishnan et al., Routy et al.）首次提供人体直接证据。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::735a6eea6250b61a60f2d9a7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"详细描述了系统综述和荟萃分析的方法，包括数据标准化策略（处理不同多样性指标和阈值）、效应量提取层级、亚组分析设计、以及GRADE证据质量评估。强调了观察性研究的因果推断限制和术语精确性（预后vs预测）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3fdef1c619b12e2eea118d7b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"建议未来研究应关注微生物组的功能潜力（而非仅分类学），采用宏基因组测序，并进行前瞻性干预试验（如饮食、益生菌、FMT）以验证因果性和治疗潜力。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ce841060b0ddf5f713ebf86b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究结论仅限于NSCLC和黑色素瘤，不能直接外推到其他实体瘤或血液肿瘤。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::803f6a171c14bc5338d08571\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"发现的关联是预后的，不等于预测性的；即微生物组特征与结局相关，但不一定特异性地预测ICI相对于其他治疗的额外获益。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1605b2f594651b7d017f5235\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"证据确定性为“中等”，主要受限于观察性研究设计和结果异质性，解读时应保持谨慎，避免过度强调因果性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7daab7f2c5b81906ec8a5377\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"对于irAEs，仅抗CTLA-4诱导的结肠炎有明确的定量保护关联证据，其他irAEs（尤其是抗PD-1相关）的证据不足或矛盾，不宜泛化。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::52a9b5cd1ace3dd43a79b291\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"机制解释是作者基于文献的推测，并非本综述的直接发现，引用时需明确区分关联证据和机制假说。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4fa1beff7cd970963a70578a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::84e209b9eec7124e6f168abb\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ada3cf980a364b30ce414824\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0204\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"abstract\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d24d24844bed48c43632e747\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0204\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c3ecf3adcf46365b03881880\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0204\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用前瞻性观察性研究设计。纳入2018年11月至2022年4月期间接受ICI治疗的80例晚期HCC患者。通过宏基因组测序分析细菌群落，通过ITS2测序分析真菌群落，并通过代谢组学分析代谢产物。将患者分为持久临床获益（DCB）和非持久临床获益（NDB）两组，比较两组间微生物多样性、物种组成及代谢物的差异。利用统计建模筛选预测ICI持续获益的细菌物种模型，并识别预测生存的预后生物标志物。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ca894a19b9d6186300e39433\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0204\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"首次在多组学水平描述了ICI治疗HCC患者中肠道细菌、真菌及其代谢物的状态和特征。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代具体的统计校正方法、样本量计算依据、外部验证情况以及潜在的混杂因素控制细节。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::529d5d3fb9dcc888fd8bbfe5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0204\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了基于多界微生物群的ICI疗效预测和预后评估的生物标志物候选列表。\",\n          \"limits\": \"预测模型的泛化能力仅限于当前80人的单中心或特定队列，缺乏独立验证集的支持；作者声称的“首次”描述需结合领域内其他类似研究进行核实，且单一队列的结果可能存在情境依赖性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ff7855f2bf0d8e5cf45f51c0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0204\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"DCB组 vs NDB组\",\n          \"finding\": \"细菌和代谢物在DCB与NDB组之间差异显著，而真菌的差异较小。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::23afa824a5a804acab5002bf\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0204\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"治疗前基线状态\",\n          \"finding\": \"DCB组的细菌和真菌整体多样性高于NDB组；这种多样性差异在治疗6-8周后开始发生变化。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7d922f870245277cb78e9a52\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0204\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"预测模型构建\",\n          \"finding\": \"建立了包含18个细菌物种的模型，用于预测免疫治疗是否带来持续获益，曲线下面积（AUC）为75.63%。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::08aefcf8d29c72c241e63b18\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0204\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"预后生物标志物筛选\",\n          \"finding\": \"筛选出两种细菌（Actinomyces_sp_ICM47, Senegalimassilia_anaerobia）和一种代谢物（galanthaminone）作为ICI治疗HCC患者生存的预后生物标志物。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2a79995effce4261969675a5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0204\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ef87d1d6193307757b844816\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0204\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管已有研究探讨肠道细菌与ICI反应的联系，但ICI治疗HCC队列中多界（细菌、真菌）微生物组的改变及其相互作用尚不完全清楚。本研究试图填补这一知识空白，探索多界微生物群作为ICI疗效预测和预后生物标志物的潜力。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::183043c3b1c9680f25443df6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0204\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的晚期肝细胞癌（HCC）患者队列，涉及肠道细菌、真菌及其代谢产物的多组学分析。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ed7c33dc13b8de7d574213bb\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0204\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究旨在阐明多界肠道微生物群在ICI治疗HCC中的特征及其与临床疗效的关系。研究前瞻性纳入了80名接受ICI治疗的晚期HCC患者，利用宏基因组学、ITS2测序和代谢组学数据，对患者的肠道细菌、真菌及代谢物进行了多组学表征。研究比较了具有持久临床获益（DCB）与非持久临床获益（NDB）患者在治疗前后的微生物多样性变化，并尝试建立基于微生物特征的预测模型。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::64ab749a06f23eea2ace9352\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0204\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"结果来自HCC特定人群，外推至其他实体瘤需谨慎；预测模型未经外部验证；仅展示了关联性，未直接证明因果机制。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肠道细菌和代谢物多样性及组成与ICI疗效（DCB vs NDB）关联的具体证据，显示细菌/代谢物差异显著而真菌差异较小；同时提供了基于18种细菌的预测模型（AUC=75.63%）。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::545d6f781672ec9a07c0a821\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0204\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"摘要未提供这些生物标志物具体的生物学作用机制或实验验证路径；仅为观察性关联，不能直接推断因果机制；样本量有限，可能存在假阳性风险。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"识别了与生存相关的特定细菌物种（Actinomyces_sp_ICM47, Senegalimassilia_anaerobia）和代谢物（galanthaminone），暗示这些分子可能与免疫治疗的长期效果或患者生存有关。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::747964e83aa76daae4a56be8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0204\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"研究强调了“多界”（multi-kingdom）微生物组的概念，即细菌、真菌和代谢物共同构成复杂的生态系统。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fd1b4e369eef5db85c871b93\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0204\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"研究发现真菌在DCB/NDB间的差异小于细菌，提示不同微生物类群对ICI反应的贡献度可能不同。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2b01ff87b0b1ef6f4f50fdaf\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0204\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究针对的是肝细胞癌（HCC）这一特定实体瘤，其微生物组特征和治疗反应可能与其他实体瘤存在差异，外推时需考虑肿瘤类型特异性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::aee00b010b822ee2c2e493c1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0204\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"预测模型基于80人的队列，缺乏独立验证，其临床实用性和泛化能力有待进一步证实。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3881c3b0703171184ef19a9f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0204\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"作者声称的“首次”多组学描述需结合领域现状谨慎解读，可能存在其他类似研究未被本摘要涵盖。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::144c11aae9ad6505311c8cab\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0204\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"观察性研究设计无法确立因果关系，发现的生物标志物仅为潜在关联，需后续功能实验验证。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9b5559c8c8b841e3093731c9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0204\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"identity\",\n              \"reason\": \"source identity was not independently verified\",\n              \"status\": \"input_attributed\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"no complete research body was indexed\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"html\",\n              \"reason\": \"html_not_scholarly_body\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"html\",\n              \"reason\": \"html_challenge_or_login\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"only abstract or non-title snippets were available\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"abstract_only\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd3\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cea482f2e2f8c231afd6ce03\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4d51e5111995d479ac204855\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8ee5a9383b2afdaa5c1326e9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用前瞻性观察性队列设计。收集23名mCRPC患者在基线及治疗期间的直肠拭子（粪便）和口腔漱口水样本。使用Ion Torrent平台进行16S rRNA基因多重高变区测序，结合DADA2去噪和QIIME2分析流程进行物种分类。使用GLM整合多区域数据以评估差异丰度。通过qPCR独立验证关键菌种（S. salivarius, A. muciniphila）。纵向分析了9名患者的全程治疗样本以评估时间效应。将结果与既往文献及Shaikh等人的“综合指数”进行比较。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f316b32406a559e063321e21\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了首个针对mCRPC患者在接受ICI治疗前/初期微生物组特征的系统描述，揭示了该人群中特有的微生物-反应关联模式（如S. salivarius的正向关联和A. muciniphila的负向关联）。\",\n          \"limits\": \"样本量较小（n=23），统计效力有限；仅使用16S rRNA测序而非宏基因组，分辨率受限；未深入探讨具体的代谢机制或因果路径；结果可能受既往恩杂鲁胺治疗、饮食、地理因素等混杂因素影响；作者承认部分分类学鉴定存在不确定性（如Roseburia属）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6ec3f9ffb629d6a51133142e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"First Timepoint cohort (n=23), 16S sequencing & qPCR\",\n          \"finding\": \"整体α和β多样性在反应者与非反应者间无显著差异；个体间变异占主导（~50%）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9d2025bfc4afb44a959e7a39\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"First Timepoint cohort, GLM analysis of multiple hypervariable regions\",\n          \"finding\": \"Streptococcus salivarius在反应者粪便中显著富集（p=0.004），且qPCR证实该趋势；但该菌在口腔漱口水中的水平与反应无关，且口腔与粪便水平不相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fc83d59bc85334f3faa9c2cb\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"First Timepoint cohort, 16S sequencing (V6-7 region) & qPCR\",\n          \"finding\": \"Akkermansia muciniphila在反应者中显著降低（与黑色素瘤等其他癌症报道相反），qPCR确认了这一减少趋势。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bda9398beeaca0e40b1be14c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Longitudinal analysis (n=9 patients across treatment cycles)\",\n          \"finding\": \"帕博利珠单抗治疗未引起全局微生物组成的显著变化；个体内样本聚类紧密，时间点对变异贡献极小（<3%）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e4f1b0368c2482cbe4cd9f10\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Application of Shaikh et al. integrated index\",\n          \"finding\": \"该综合指数未能区分本队列中的反应者与非反应者，表明不同癌症类型或治疗史可能导致微生物信号的特异性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5311a5785c595293f6da034c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7bf91791d72061e224f94980\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"既往研究表明肠道微生物影响ICI疗效，但在mCRPC背景下，特别是经过雄激素受体抑制剂（如恩杂鲁胺）预处理后的患者中，微生物组特征如何预测帕博利珠单抗的治疗反应？是否存在不同于其他实体瘤（如黑色素瘤）的微生物标志物？\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0bb8230bd3b4569513ecd72d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"转移性去势抵抗性前列腺癌（mCRPC）患者，在恩杂鲁胺治疗进展后接受抗PD-1免疫检查点抑制剂（帕博利珠单抗）治疗。样本为粪便和口腔漱口水DNA。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4cb85d2bc4c086b0bb4325b4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在探究肠道微生物组组成与mCRPC患者对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗反应的关联。研究纳入了23名在恩杂鲁胺治疗下疾病进展并即将开始帕博利珠单抗治疗的mCRPC患者。通过16S rRNA基因测序（覆盖多个高变区）和定量PCR（qPCR），比较了治疗反应者（PSA下降>50%或影像学缓解）与非反应者的微生物特征。研究发现，尽管整体α和β多样性在主要队列中无显著差异，但特定菌属存在差异：反应者中粪肠球菌、拟杆菌等富集，而此前在其他癌症中被认为促进ICI疗效的黏蛋白降解菌Akkermansia muciniphila在反应者中反而减少。此外，发现口腔共生菌Streptococcus salivarius在粪便中的丰度与反应正相关，但在口腔样本中无此关联，提示其作用具有部位特异性。研究还验证了一个综合微生物指数在本队列中无效，并观察到治疗期间微生物组总体稳定。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0096a87790c289f61738c19d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅限mCRPC人群，且处于恩杂鲁胺治疗失败后阶段；不能直接外推至初治前列腺癌或其他早期癌症。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了mCRPC背景下特定的微生物标志物列表：S. salivarius（正向关联）、Bacteroides thetaiotaomicron（正向关联）、Enterococcaceae（正向关联）以及Akkermansia muciniphila（负向关联）。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e9fc034cd2a3fa6bfb7f266d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"指数构建依赖于原始研究的分类学一致性，本研究中因分类差异进行了修正，结果反映的是修正后的指数表现。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"展示了基于多癌种数据的“综合指数”在本队列中失效的结果，强调了单一通用指数可能不适用于所有癌症类型。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bd48e3b304f5cb9a35091e55\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这些机制多为基于文献的推测或体外/动物模型证据，本研究本身未直接测定肌苷水平或进行功能实验，属于作者的解释性讨论而非直接实验证据。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"探讨了A. muciniphila产生肌苷（inosine）的可能机制，并提出在前列腺癌中肌苷可能促进转移的相反假说，解释了为何其在反应者中减少。同时提及S. salivarius可能通过调节PPAR gamma发挥免疫调节作用。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::759881fb89d4c045e5cae0d3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅涵盖短期治疗周期（4个周期+监测期），长期效应未知。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"纵向数据显示ICI治疗期间微生物组高度稳定，排除了治疗药物本身导致微生物组剧烈波动从而间接影响疗效的主要可能性。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f7eafbd9fdbcc65bbebf325c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"文中提到既往研究显示恩杂鲁胺等雄激素受体轴靶向治疗会增加A. muciniphila水平，这可能构成了本研究中患者基线微生物组的背景状态。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1dfd9e226110208667d5fcf3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"S. salivarius在粪便中与疗效相关，但在口腔样本中无关联，且两者水平不相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fa8a027532c43a008390aa87\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Shaikh等人的综合指数在本队列中无预测价值。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::873c23476f247afe6b8f4d1e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究结果严格限定于“恩杂鲁胺治疗进展后”的mCRPC患者，其微生物组状态深受既往内分泌治疗影响，不能直接推广至未经内分泌治疗的前列腺癌患者或初治实体瘤患者。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7bcbe549d1bc887488ac8986\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"A. muciniphila在反应者中的减少与多数其他ICI研究相反，这可能与前列腺癌的特定病理生理环境（如肌苷促转移风险）或既往用药有关，解读时需避免将其视为普适规律。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::017a7a20036f46812363f7ff\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"S. salivarius的发现虽显著，但其具体免疫调节机制在本研究中仅为推测，需结合其他功能学研究谨慎引用。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1fba0eec09372c5ec1d815d3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"样本量较小（n=23），发现的差异丰度菌群可能存在假阳性风险，尤其是qPCR验证仅针对少数几个菌种。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5e8434371ef288ce06725a7b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c4eb850c48e0c8797e786a93\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a130377080b5cd1b9dcfdcaa\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cdde249c42232941461dcc1b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"1. 数据收集与预处理：从NCBI数据库获取10个队列的宏基因组原始数据，进行质控、宿主DNA去除、标准化测序深度（rarefaction至915,968 reads）及物种丰度估算（Kraken2/Bracken）。2. 多界聚类分析：对各微生物域的相对丰数据进行Hellinger转换，计算Bray-Curtis距离矩阵并转换为相似性矩阵，赋予权重后使用WSNF算法进行样本聚类，通过轮廓系数确定最佳聚类数（分为C1和C2两个亚型）。3. 多样性与临床关联分析：使用Shannon和Observed species指数评估Alpha多样性，PCoA和PERMANOVA评估Beta多样性；结合Kaplan-Meier生存分析和卡方检验分析亚型与治疗反应（Responder/Non-Responder）、无进展生存期（PFS）及总生存期（OS）的关系。4. 差异物种鉴定与建模：在训练集（70%样本）中使用DESeq2进行跨亚型差异分析，设定阈值筛选显著差异属，构建包含32个属的多界诊断模型。5. 机器学习验证：在独立测试集（30%样本）中应用随机森林和支持向量机算法，比较多界模型与单界模型的分类性能（ROC曲线/AUC）。6. 共现网络分析：使用FastSpar工具计算SparCC相关性，构建微生物共现网络，分析节点连接度和核心菌属。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4a69a10345a76a98915cbb41\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了首个基于大规模多队列整合的多界微生物组（细菌+真菌+古菌+病毒）ICI疗效预测模型，证实多界联合特征比单一细菌特征具有更高的预测精度。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代具体的外部验证队列细节（仅提及内部70/30划分）；未提供因果机制的实验验证，仅为观察性关联；不同癌症类型和治疗方案（如抗PD-1 vs 联合疗法）的异质性处理情况未详细展开。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8918afe1508b3458874df843\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"揭示了高微生物多样性和稳定网络结构与良好ICI预后之间的关联，提出了“多界生态稳定性”作为疗效预测的新视角。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代网络分析是否控制了混杂因素（如抗生素使用、饮食等）；具体微生物介导免疫调节的分子机制仍属于推测，需后续实验验证。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::73f680b2cb25ce015b0c928d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"识别了跨界的潜在生物标志物组合（如Bacteroides与Kluyveromyces的组合），为个性化微生态干预提供了候选靶点。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代这些标志物在不同种族、地理区域人群中的普适性验证结果；部分低丰度微生物界（如病毒、古菌）的信号可能受测序深度和技术偏差影响。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a06d831e0fc3bfa9575865c1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"基于WSNF聚类的两个亚型（C1 vs C2），涉及965例多癌种ICI治疗患者\",\n          \"finding\": \"C2亚型表现出显著更高的Alpha多样性（Shannon和Observed species指数）和更复杂的Beta多样性结构；C2亚型中响应者比例更高，且总体生存期（OS）和无进展生存期（PFS > 6个月）显著优于C1亚型。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0c84a99ade10a4cb256364e9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"多界微生物组成差异分析\",\n          \"finding\": \"C2亚型富集有益菌属，如细菌界的Bacteroides、Parabacteroides，真菌界的Kluyveromyces；C1亚型富集潜在有害菌属，如Malassezia。古菌和病毒界也显示出显著的亚型特异性分布。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::dfcab8dadc4c8affa27f2f3c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"机器学习模型预测效能比较\",\n          \"finding\": \"由32个多界微生物属组成的诊断模型在区分ICI疗效方面表现出优于单一细菌、真菌、古菌或病毒模型的预测准确性（更高的AUC值）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::898f31aa8ea8f4c61c221c71\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"微生物共现网络分析\",\n          \"finding\": \"C2亚型的微生物共现网络更为密集和稳健，强正相关连接（|ρ| > 0.5）的数量显著多于C1亚型；拟杆菌属（Bacteroides）在C2中为核心枢纽菌属，而Komagataella在C1中更具中心性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1c55a5039601bdb08ac540ee\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d0255eff72f4dc2d4be6accd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"既往关于肠道微生物组与ICI疗效的研究主要局限于细菌领域，忽略了真菌、古菌和病毒等其他微生物界的作用。本研究试图解决以下问题：1. 多界微生物组的整体特征是否存在特定的分型模式？2. 这些多界微生物特征是否能比单一细菌特征更准确地预测ICI治疗的疗效？3. 不同微生物界之间的相互作用网络如何影响治疗效果？\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b6953e0d3a8043bde691d4de\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究针对接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的多种实体瘤患者，研究对象为肠道多界微生物组（包括细菌、真菌、古菌和病毒）。数据来源于全球7个国家的10个队列，共1712名患者的粪便宏基因组测序数据。最终纳入分析的有效样本为965例，涵盖黑色素瘤、非小细胞肺癌、胃肠道肿瘤和肾细胞癌等。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::48ac19000f258425abe5e365\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在评估多界微生物组及其相互作用对ICI治疗疗效的预测价值。作者整合了来自多个队列的大规模宏基因组数据，利用加权相似性网络融合（WSNF）方法将四种微生物域的数据整合并进行聚类，识别出两种患者亚型（C1和C2）。研究发现，C2亚型具有更高的微生物多样性、更稳定的共现网络结构，且与更好的ICI治疗反应和预后显著相关。通过差异分析和机器学习模型，作者筛选出包含32个属的多界微生物特征组合，其预测ICI疗效的准确性优于单一界别的模型。此外，研究还揭示了特定有益菌属（如拟杆菌属、克鲁维酵母属）和潜在有害菌属（如马拉色菌属）在不同亚型中的分布差异及其与免疫调节机制的关联。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2b97608fb6d4f94f1b9a33c2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"该结论基于回顾性队列数据的观察性关联，不能直接推断因果关系；不同癌症类型和治疗方案的混合可能引入异质性，需谨慎外推至特定单一癌种或特定药物类别。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了多界微生物组特征（特别是高多样性和特定属的组合）与ICI疗效正相关的实证证据。指出C2亚型（高多样性、富含Bacteroides/Kluyveromyces）与更好的治疗反应和生存率相关，而C1亚型（低多样性、富含Malassezia）与较差预后相关。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::83561df9577bb9b3b630c124\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"所给材料未提供直接的机制实验数据（如动物模型或体外细胞实验），所有机制解释均为基于文献的推测和关联分析，属于理论假说层面，需注明其为作者的解释而非已验证的因果链条。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提出了多界微生物通过维持肠道生态稳定性和产生免疫调节代谢物（如短链脂肪酸）来增强抗肿瘤免疫的潜在机制假设。讨论了Bacteroides fragilis诱导树突状细胞成熟和Th1细胞浸润，以及Malassezia激活补体级联反应导致免疫抑制的可能路径。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::78c0836b9a8d3729c6bb23ea\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"使用了WSNF方法整合多界宏基因组数据，并通过机器学习（随机森林/SVM）构建预测模型。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3124b140ef48214b18522c42\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"讨论了抗生素使用对微生物多样性的负面影响，以及粪菌移植（FMT）、益生菌（Clostridium butyricum）和益生元（inulin-type fructans）在改善ICI疗效中的潜在应用。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::acc4f86be6d51ea935fc5098\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究为观察性回顾性分析，发现的是微生物特征与疗效的统计学关联，而非因果证明。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cf70d829836bf649083a164b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"数据来自多个国家和癌种，存在潜在的批次效应和人群异质性，尽管作者进行了标准化处理，但外推至特定单一群体时需考虑情境依赖性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7a3c458274dcf115831a566c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"多界微生物中病毒和古菌的丰度较低，其检测灵敏度和生物学意义可能受技术限制，解读时需注意低丰度信号的不确定性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::954c087eec683fcf3af743d3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"作者提出的机制（如Bacteroides诱导Th1，Malassezia激活补体）引用自其他研究，并非本研究的直接实验发现，需明确区分为本研究的关联发现与文献支持的机制假设。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::efea53feb336b67806dc914e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::318963856f1951debff390b4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0565\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::08de776306040abe73aecd87\",\n          \"snapshot::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cc6e9d9dbcf8904943e682a9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0565\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::08de776306040abe73aecd87\",\n          \"snapshot::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fdec5075cda50780958d8f2e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0565\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"遵循PRISMA 2020指南进行系统综述。单一评审员执行文献搜索、筛选、数据提取和偏倚风险评估。使用ROBINS-I工具评估观察性研究的偏倚风险。由于临床、方法和统计异质性过大，无法进行定量荟萃分析，因此采用基于效应方向和一致性的叙事综合（Narrative Synthesis）。重点分析了特定菌属/种、代谢通路、饮食因素以及纵向动态变化。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::08de776306040abe73aecd87\",\n          \"snapshot::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4b7fe47de065df24431a07bc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0565\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了截至2025年关于肠道微生物组与黑色素瘤ICI反应关联的全面定性综合，明确了SCFA产生菌的积极角色和真菌失调的消极角色，并指出了微生物组作为预测生物标志物和潜在治疗靶点的潜力。\",\n          \"limits\": \"由于严重的异质性，无法提供定量效应估计。证据主要来自观察性研究，存在显著的混杂和选择偏倚。结论受限于纳入研究的规模小、单中心设计以及分析方法的不一致性。不能直接外推至其他癌症类型或不同免疫疗法组合。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::08de776306040abe73aecd87\",\n          \"snapshot::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::938e71d76663e61501972ebd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0565\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"多数队列中\",\n          \"finding\": \"产短链脂肪酸（SCFA）的菌属（如Faecalibacterium prausnitzii, Akkermansia muciniphila, Bifidobacterium）丰度增加通常与治疗反应改善相关；而病原体或真菌（如Candida albicans, Malassezia restricta）富集或与失调相关的特征则与疗效降低和不良生存结局相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::08de776306040abe73aecd87\",\n          \"snapshot::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2179546388fe33b2e37076a9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0565\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"跨队列比较时\",\n          \"finding\": \"微生物组-反应关联具有高度异质性和队列依赖性。没有单一的微生物签名能一致地预测所有队列的反应。例如，F. prausnitzii在某些队列中与无反应相关，而在其他大型再分析中被识别为一致的阳性生物标志物。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::08de776306040abe73aecd87\",\n          \"snapshot::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c7584d00f2e05f3e1c15e1d9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0565\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"机制层面\",\n          \"finding\": \"微生物衍生的代谢物（如SCFA、钴胺素）可能通过调节树突状细胞功能、抗原呈递和T细胞激活来影响抗肿瘤免疫。纵向数据显示，治疗期间A. muciniphila的丢失可能与早期耐药性相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::08de776306040abe73aecd87\",\n          \"snapshot::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::373f32f8bc3e6618a2bb78ca\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0565\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"证据质量\",\n          \"finding\": \"纳入的25项研究中，17项（68%）被评定为中度偏倚风险，8项（32%）为严重偏倚风险。主要偏倚来源包括残留混杂因素和小样本单中心设计。没有研究被评为低风险。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::08de776306040abe73aecd87\",\n          \"snapshot::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7d7587eb8993cdf4013907d1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0565\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::08de776306040abe73aecd87\",\n          \"snapshot::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2b0db90d979da2168d366c90\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0565\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管免疫检查点抑制剂改善了黑色素瘤患者的临床结局，但治疗反应差异巨大且缺乏可靠的预测生物标志物。本研究旨在解决：肠道微生物组的哪些特征（组成、多样性、功能）与ICI的治疗反应相关？其潜在的生物学机制是什么？当前的证据基础质量如何？\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::08de776306040abe73aecd87\",\n          \"snapshot::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::15579518b50eb196b81bb83c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0565\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"人类黑色素瘤患者，接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI，包括抗PD-1、抗PD-L1或抗CTLA-4）治疗。聚焦于肠道微生物组（组成、多样性、代谢功能）与治疗反应（疗效及免疫相关不良事件irAEs）之间的关联。纳入2015-2025年间发表的观察性研究和数据集二次分析，排除干预性试验和仅暴露研究。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::08de776306040abe73aecd87\",\n          \"snapshot::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::87cdb1d49ace86cdf4fe5065\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0565\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"这是一篇系统综述，旨在评估肠道微生物组特征与黑色素瘤患者免疫检查点抑制剂治疗反应之间的关联及其潜在机制。作者通过PubMed数据库检索并筛选出25项符合条件的观察性研究，采用定性综合而非定量荟萃分析的方法，因为各研究在测序平台、分类方法、结果定义和分析流程上存在显著异质性。研究评估了微生物组成、多样性及代谢功能对治疗结局的影响，并使用了ROBINS-I工具对纳入研究的偏倚风险进行了正式评估。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::08de776306040abe73aecd87\",\n          \"snapshot::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d8a2f9c469d95bbd2fcf7e8e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0565\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这些关联主要基于观察性研究，存在混杂因素。不同队列间结果不一致，不能简单地将某一菌属视为通用生物标志物。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了具体的微生物特征与ICI疗效关联的证据汇总：产SCFA菌（F. prausnitzii, A. muciniphila）通常与良好反应相关，而真菌失调（Candida, Malassezia）与较差反应相关。同时指出这种关联是异质的，没有单一的一致性签名。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::08de776306040abe73aecd87\",\n          \"snapshot::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6353277b76ca3f94e31fbe6d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0565\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"许多机制证据来自动物模型或体外研究，在黑色素瘤患者中的直接因果证据有限。综述本身未提供新的实验数据，而是综合现有解释。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"阐述了微生物组影响免疫治疗的潜在机制：SCFA促进树突状细胞成熟、抗原呈递和CD8+ T细胞激活；微生物屏障完整性受损可能导致免疫抑制。还提到了纵向动态变化（如A. muciniphila丢失预示耐药）作为早期指标。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::08de776306040abe73aecd87\",\n          \"snapshot::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::85f2c57212b2af458d68af2d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0565\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"综述指出当前研究存在严重的异质性，包括测序平台、生物信息学管道、差异丰度分析方法（如LEfSe, DESeq2, ANCOM）的不一致，以及组成型数据的统计陷阱。这解释了为什么难以获得统一的生物标志物。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::08de776306040abe73aecd87\",\n          \"snapshot::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b51d1aa1a071a0ad56186c4f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0565\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"提到饮食（纤维、Omega-3）、抗生素使用、地理变异和宿主遗传是常见的混杂因素。大多数研究是小样本单中心设计，偏倚风险高。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::08de776306040abe73aecd87\",\n          \"snapshot::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2fa55144dd6936958f9ca74b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0565\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"指出某些研究发现α多样性与反应无关，或特定菌属在不同队列中表现相反（如F. prausnitzii在某些情况下与无反应相关）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::08de776306040abe73aecd87\",\n          \"snapshot::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9c35f083340ae354c42df6ca\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0565\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该综述仅针对黑色素瘤，虽然机制可能与其他实体瘤有重叠，但不能直接假设其在所有实体瘤中具有相同的效力或特异性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::08de776306040abe73aecd87\",\n          \"snapshot::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6a8ee95b372bbddb17edcded\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0565\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"纳入的研究均为观察性设计，因此发现的关联不等于因果关系。尽管引用了一项小鼠干预研究支持因果性，但这属于外部证据，非本综述的主要发现。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::08de776306040abe73aecd87\",\n          \"snapshot::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::741f5d210706336bf85b893a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0565\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"由于异质性，综述未提供合并效应量。任何关于特定菌属效应的解读都应谨慎，避免将其视为确定的预测标准。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::08de776306040abe73aecd87\",\n          \"snapshot::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5739c36a11fda93014ea8f6b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0565\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"综述承认未进行定量荟萃分析，因此其结论是基于叙事综合，可能存在选择偏倚或主观解释。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::08de776306040abe73aecd87\",\n          \"snapshot::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d32f64d557afe254ad0447cb\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0565\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::08de776306040abe73aecd87\",\n          \"snapshot::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::36aa7c16dd9aa335f125602a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0545\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494\",\n          \"snapshot::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::eec523ebb51b576f83a906d5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0545\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494\",\n          \"snapshot::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::336d3e9f649133c8318edf00\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0545\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用前瞻性队列研究设计。纳入标准：组织学确诊的不可切除III期或IV期皮肤黑色素瘤患者，接受抗PD-1单药治疗（纳武利尤单抗或帕博利珠单抗）。对照组为患者的直系亲属（健康人）。主要终点：根据RECIST v.1.1标准评估的治疗反应（完全缓解CR、部分缓解PR定义为响应者；疾病稳定SD、进展PD定义为非响应者）。数据采集：治疗前通过问卷收集社会人口学、临床、生活方式和饮食变量；采集基线粪便样本。实验室分析：使用DNeasy PowerSoil Pro提取DNA，扩增16S rRNA基因V3-V4区进行Illumina MiSeq测序，使用DADA2流程生成ASVs并基于SILVA数据库进行分类；对部分样本进行宏基因组鸟枪法测序以重建MAGs。统计分析：比较各组间的菌群多样性（Alpha/Beta）、相对丰度及临床特征差异，使用Kruskal-Wallis检验、Fisher精确检验及limma线性模型识别差异物种。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494\",\n          \"snapshot::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7ba2dfedc1eb207addb32c68\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0545\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了波兰这一特定欧洲人群背景下，肠道微生物组特征与抗PD-1治疗反应的关联证据，指出了与该人群饮食模式（如高植物摄入）相关的潜在有益菌属（P. copri, B. uniformis）。\",\n          \"limits\": \"样本量较小（尤其是对照组仅10人，且年龄显著小于患者组）；观察性研究设计无法确立因果关系；饮食数据依赖自我报告问卷，可能存在回忆偏倚；未直接测量微生物代谢产物机制；不同研究间关于特定菌属（如Faecalibacterium）作用的矛盾结果提示人群异质性，限制了单一生物标志物的普适性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494\",\n          \"snapshot::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f3dabf81aac85365acaa0d7d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0545\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"波兰黑色素瘤患者队列，基线状态\",\n          \"finding\": \"响应者（n=25）的拟杆菌门/厚壁菌门比值显著高于非响应者（n=32），且响应者的细菌物种丰富度（Richness）显著低于非响应者。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494\",\n          \"snapshot::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::03ad9e12f07b47f5c940696d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0545\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"波兰黑色素瘤患者队列，基线状态\",\n          \"finding\": \"响应者肠道中普雷沃氏菌（Prevotella copri）和均匀拟杆菌（Bacteroides uniformis）的丰度显著升高；非响应者中普拉梭菌（Faecalibacterium prausnitzii）、肠脱硫弧菌（Desulfovibrio intestinalis）及部分未分类厚壁菌显著富集。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494\",\n          \"snapshot::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::afb811ac51851f8ef1c79e86\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0545\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"波兰黑色素瘤患者队列，基线饮食调查\",\n          \"finding\": \"高植物性食物（水果和蔬菜总和）摄入与响应概率增加2.9倍相关；低乳制品摄入（每日≤1份）与响应概率增加2.0倍相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494\",\n          \"snapshot::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::072e088bef5b876efe98b6a4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0545\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"波兰黑色素瘤患者队列，基线状态\",\n          \"finding\": \"响应者的粪便钙卫蛋白水平（炎症标志物）中位数低于非响应者，但组间差异无统计学意义。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494\",\n          \"snapshot::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b0757ddd3362ddc16e521525\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0545\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494\",\n          \"snapshot::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::19e0ec894f1eb5a1184b3d6d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0545\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"在波兰人群中，基线肠道微生物组的组成以及饮食等外在因素是否与黑色素瘤患者对抗PD-1治疗的临床反应（响应 vs. 非响应）相关？是否存在人群特异性的微生物标志物？\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494\",\n          \"snapshot::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::863cf7d94bd87e259d9fdeb2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0545\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"波兰人群中的转移性黑色素瘤患者（接受抗PD-1治疗）及健康对照，聚焦基线肠道微生物组组成、饮食模式与免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效的关联。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494\",\n          \"snapshot::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ba74aefc5df7bb8b114ac5d3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0545\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在探讨波兰裔黑色素瘤患者对抗PD-1治疗的反应与其基线肠道微生物组及外在修饰因素（如饮食）之间的关联。研究招募了64名接受抗PD-1治疗的患者和10名健康对照，通过问卷调查收集人口统计学、生活方式和饮食数据，并在治疗前采集粪便样本进行16S rRNA基因测序（metataxonomics）及部分宏基因组鸟枪法测序。结果显示，响应者（R）与非响应者（NR）在肠道菌群结构上存在显著差异：响应者的拟杆菌门/厚壁菌门（Bacteroidota/Firmicutes）比值较高，物种丰富度较低；响应者肠道中普雷沃氏菌（Prevotella copri）和均匀拟杆菌（Bacteroides uniformis）丰度较高，而非响应者则富集普拉梭菌（Faecalibacterium prausnitzii）、肠脱硫弧菌（Desulfovibrio intestinalis）及部分未分类厚壁菌。此外，高植物摄入和低乳制品摄入与更好的治疗反应相关。该研究强调了肠道微生物组和饮食对ICI疗效的影响具有人群特异性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494\",\n          \"snapshot::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::efd525b8d51c8646673bf5ad\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0545\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅限波兰人群，不能直接外推至其他种族或地理区域；观察性关联，非因果证明。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了波兰人群中与抗PD-1治疗响应正相关的特定微生物类群（P. copri, B. uniformis）和负相关类群（F. prausnitzii, D. intestinalis）的具体数据。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494\",\n          \"snapshot::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::825c7f4f98b5e07f9c30a0ec\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0545\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"基于自我报告问卷，缺乏对具体营养成分或代谢产物的直接测量；混杂因素（如整体生活方式）未完全控制。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了饮食模式（高植物摄入、低乳制品摄入）与ICI治疗响应相关的流行病学证据。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494\",\n          \"snapshot::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::924f3d1141577180ee5bcbb0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0545\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"钙卫蛋白差异无统计学意义；未直接测定免疫细胞浸润或细胞因子水平；机制链条不完整。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"探讨了肠道菌群组成与宿主肠道炎症状态（通过粪便钙卫蛋白衡量）的潜在联系，尽管统计上不显著，但趋势显示响应者炎症水平较低。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494\",\n          \"snapshot::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0ab239de79b2493b354259b7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0545\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"作者指出与其他队列（如中国NSCLC患者中P. copri有益，或某些黑色素瘤队列中Faecalibacterium有益）结果的矛盾，强调单一物种不能作为跨人群的通用生物标志物。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494\",\n          \"snapshot::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9e01134b66ca5c18493345af\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0545\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"研究发现高植物摄入和低乳制品摄入与良好预后相关，并引用文献说明膳食纤维可能通过产生短链脂肪酸（SCFAs）增强T细胞反应。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494\",\n          \"snapshot::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b9ee09f7293357ceedf2c7af\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0545\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究的发现基于波兰特定人群，其微生物组特征受当地饮食和文化影响，结果不能直接推广到其他种族或地区。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494\",\n          \"snapshot::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::089fc94ec405841194913163\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0545\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"对照组年龄显著小于患者组，且样本量小，这可能影响基线微生物组比较的解释力，需谨慎对待与健康对照的比较结果。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494\",\n          \"snapshot::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c90a11b11848cab5e8c2f7f7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0545\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"饮食数据来自问卷，存在主观性和回忆偏差，且未量化具体营养素摄入量，仅能反映大致饮食模式。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494\",\n          \"snapshot::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::854f2417fb331859fb4ff475\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0545\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"虽然发现了微生物与响应的关联，但未阐明具体的分子机制（如代谢产物、抗原模拟等），因此不能用于解释确切的生物学通路。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494\",\n          \"snapshot::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::55c6fd10a6749abc57a112b9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0545\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"identity\",\n              \"reason\": \"source identity was not independently verified\",\n              \"status\": \"input_attributed\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"pdf\",\n              \"reason\": \"full-page text extracted; page positions retained\",\n              \"status\": \"fitz\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"fitz\",\n              \"reason\": \"layout, table relations, formulas, figure pixels, and scanned text may be lost\",\n              \"status\": \"known_gap\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494\",\n          \"snapshot::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::58a07a3130629388f7219512\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0478\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e7b396e8ca2b15ce24520d38\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b75506ec2945a26ee7c804c9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0478\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e7b396e8ca2b15ce24520d38\",\n          \"snapshot::6cbf5c2e297396b264657b8e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5d3b818dded26c255a8e023a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0478\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The study utilized a multi-cohort design combining prospective observational cohorts (PRIMM-UK, PRIMM-NL) and retrospective cohorts (Manchester, Leeds, Barcelona) alongside public datasets. Baseline stool samples were subjected to shotgun metagenomic sequencing. Taxonomic profiling was performed using MetaPhlAn 3.0, and functional potential using HUMAnN 3.0. Statistical associations were tested using PERMANOVA, ANCOM-BC, and various differential abundance methods within a meta-analysis framework. Machine learning prediction capabilities were assessed using Lasso logistic regression with nested cross-validation for within-cohort accuracy and leave-one-cohort-out validation for cross-cohort generalizability.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e7b396e8ca2b15ce24520d38\",\n          \"snapshot::6cbf5c2e297396b264657b8e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::eeee15fdf99e533bd9e1ddae\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0478\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"Provides one of the largest integrated metagenomic analyses of ICI response in melanoma, demonstrating that while microbiome-response links exist, they are strongly context-dependent and lack universal single-species biomarkers.\",\n          \"limits\": \"Sample sizes per cohort remain relatively small for robust strain-level resolution. The study focuses on cutaneous melanoma, limiting generalizability to other solid tumors or mucosal/uveal melanoma subtypes. Confounding factors like diet and medication use were adjusted for but residual confounding cannot be fully excluded. The inability to establish universal biomarkers suggests current methodological and biological complexities prevent simple translation to clinical practice without larger, standardized trials.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e7b396e8ca2b15ce24520d38\",\n          \"snapshot::6cbf5c2e297396b264657b8e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::711aa5e1a8bdcd2e13053617\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0478\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Within individual cohorts (PRIMM-UK vs PRIMM-NL)\",\n          \"finding\": \"Microbiome composition showed significant association with ORR in PRIMM-UK (PERMANOVA P=0.05) but not in PRIMM-NL (P=0.61). Prediction accuracy varied by endpoint and cohort (e.g., AUC-ROC 0.78 for ORR in UK vs 0.53 in NL).\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e7b396e8ca2b15ce24520d38\",\n          \"snapshot::6cbf5c2e297396b264657b8e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::881ab16104a14e18bbf02cbe\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0478\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Cross-cohort integration and meta-analysis\",\n          \"finding\": \"Cohort effects explained nearly ten times more variance than clinical variables. No single bacterial species served as a fully consistent biomarker across all datasets. However, a panel of species including Bifidobacterium pseudocatenulatum, Roseburia spp., and Akkermansia muciniphila were consistently enriched in responders.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e7b396e8ca2b15ce24520d38\",\n          \"snapshot::6cbf5c2e297396b264657b8e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3af1744df727f5ab3481d47b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0478\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Machine learning prediction across cohorts\",\n          \"finding\": \"Models trained on one cohort generally failed to predict response in another (AUC-ROC often <0.6). Leave-one-cohort-out validation yielded modest average performance (AUC ~0.59-0.60), indicating limited cross-population reproducibility of microbiome-based signatures.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e7b396e8ca2b15ce24520d38\",\n          \"snapshot::6cbf5c2e297396b264657b8e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3458b221f48237aedb8a5d53\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0478\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e7b396e8ca2b15ce24520d38\",\n          \"snapshot::6cbf5c2e297396b264657b8e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c68df99cc6f654c401dc5324\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0478\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"To determine if there are consistent, reproducible gut microbiome biomarkers (taxonomic or functional) associated with response to ICIs in melanoma patients, and to assess the extent of cohort-specific variability that may explain lack of consensus in previous literature.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e7b396e8ca2b15ce24520d38\",\n          \"snapshot::6cbf5c2e297396b264657b8e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::259f0cfcceea861e804f58f0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0478\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Advanced cutaneous melanoma patients treated with immune checkpoint inhibitors (ICIs); gut microbiome composition and functional potential; multiple observational cohorts across UK, Netherlands, Spain, and public datasets.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e7b396e8ca2b15ce24520d38\",\n          \"snapshot::6cbf5c2e297396b264657b8e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6a69a5c040e1b8910d141b78\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0478\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"This study investigates the association between baseline gut microbiome features and clinical response to ICIs in advanced melanoma. By integrating shotgun metagenomic sequencing data from five newly recruited cohorts (n=165) with 147 samples from previously published studies, the authors aimed to reconcile conflicting findings from smaller single-cohort studies. The research employed multivariate statistical analyses, machine learning models (Lasso), and meta-analysis approaches to identify microbial taxa and functions associated with overall response rate (ORR) and progression-free survival at 12 months (PFS12). The work highlights that while the microbiome is relevant to ICI response, these associations are highly cohort-dependent, with limited reproducibility of specific biomarkers or predictive signatures across different populations.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e7b396e8ca2b15ce24520d38\",\n          \"snapshot::6cbf5c2e297396b264657b8e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fe0dec80666633592dcad0eb\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0478\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"These associations are not perfect predictors; no single species is a definitive biomarker. The effect size and consistency vary, and the study emphasizes complexity over simple presence/absence rules.\",\n          \"contribution\": \"Identifies a panel of species (Bifidobacterium pseudocatenulatum, Roseburia spp., Akkermansia muciniphila) consistently associated with responders across multiple datasets, providing specific taxonomic candidates for further investigation rather than dismissing the microbiome's role entirely.\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e7b396e8ca2b15ce24520d38\",\n          \"snapshot::6cbf5c2e297396b264657b8e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::32c5f04ef051c11ca5062f38\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0478\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"Performance metrics are specific to this dataset combination; other studies might find better generalization with different preprocessing or larger sample sizes.\",\n          \"contribution\": \"Demonstrates limited cross-cohort reproducibility of machine learning models trained on microbiome data, with AUC-ROC values dropping significantly when applied to external cohorts.\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e7b396e8ca2b15ce24520d38\",\n          \"snapshot::6cbf5c2e297396b264657b8e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::66a27728e46419a96c6ad964\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0478\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"These are correlative associations based on metagenomic potential; actual functional activity and host interaction mechanisms are not directly measured or proven in this study.\",\n          \"contribution\": \"Discusses functional pathways (e.g., glycosyltransferases, DNA adenine methylases) associated with response, offering mechanistic hypotheses beyond taxonomy.\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e7b396e8ca2b15ce24520d38\",\n          \"snapshot::6cbf5c2e297396b264657b8e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::641ad45d7ac102a72b9eacf9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0478\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Discussion of cohort effects explaining variance more than clinical parameters; comparison with colorectal cancer meta-analyses showing stronger consistency.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e7b396e8ca2b15ce24520d38\",\n          \"snapshot::6cbf5c2e297396b264657b8e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ca01d309185202b9fe80ef74\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0478\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Analysis showing PPI use strongly links to microbiome structure but is independent of ICI response.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e7b396e8ca2b15ce24520d38\",\n          \"snapshot::6cbf5c2e297396b264657b8e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::18af5dcd37e15bed90913de7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0478\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Findings are specific to advanced cutaneous melanoma; do not generalize to other cancer types or ICI regimens without caution.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e7b396e8ca2b15ce24520d38\",\n          \"snapshot::6cbf5c2e297396b264657b8e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e951f568c61ee11c7152e105\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0478\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The 'lack of universal biomarkers' conclusion is based on the specific cohorts and analytical methods used; it does not prove that no such biomarkers exist, but rather that they are difficult to identify with current data scales.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e7b396e8ca2b15ce24520d38\",\n          \"snapshot::6cbf5c2e297396b264657b8e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::caf257acc372bd444babd978\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0478\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Associations identified are correlational; causal mechanisms are inferred or hypothesized but not demonstrated.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e7b396e8ca2b15ce24520d38\",\n          \"snapshot::6cbf5c2e297396b264657b8e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c25e964cd5588404f56e8f43\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0478\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"deep_read_material\",\n          \"current_question_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"examples\": [\n            {\n              \"attribution\": \"本研究\",\n              \"conditions\": \"研究对象为接受ICI治疗的晚期皮肤黑色素瘤患者；终点指标为客观缓解率（ORR）和12个月无进展生存期（PFS12）；分析方法包括PERMANOVA、Lasso机器学习模型（100次重复五折分层交叉验证）、以及包含8种差异丰度方法的随机效应荟萃分析；比较对象包括PRIMM-UK、PRIMM-NL、Manchester、Leeds、Barcelona队列及4个公开数据集（Matson et al., Gopalakrishnan et al., Frankel et al., WindTT_2020等）。\",\n              \"finding\": \"在整合5个新测序队列（n=165）和4个公开队列（n=147）后，PERMANOVA分析显示“队列”因素对微生物群落组成的解释方差是其他任何变量（包括临床参数）的近十倍。机器学习模型验证显示，基于物种丰度的预测能力在不同队列间缺乏可重复性：仅在PRIMM-NL中PFS12预测AUC-ROC为0.64，在PRIMM-UK中ORR预测AUC-ROC为0.78；而在跨队列测试中，仅约31.4%的情况AUC-ROC超过0.6，且留一法交叉验证的平均AUC-ROC仅为0.59-0.60。尽管通过荟萃分析识别出与反应者相关的物种面板（如Bifidobacterium pseudocatenulatum, Roseburia spp., Akkermansia muciniphila），但没有任何单一细菌在所有数据集中成为完全一致的生物标志物。相比之下，结直肠癌数据的相同方法显示出强且一致的生物标志物，证明该结果并非由分析方法导致。\",\n              \"reference_ids\": [],\n              \"use_in_review\": \"提供跨队列黑色素瘤免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗反应研究中‘无通用标志物’的具体统计证据及异质性来源分析，作为直接材料。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"attribution\": \"Routy et al. (2018)\",\n              \"conditions\": \"针对上皮肿瘤患者的PD-1免疫疗法反应研究；使用宏基因组测序分析粪便样本。\",\n              \"finding\": \"发现ICI反应者中Akermansia muciniphila、Alistipes属和厚壁菌门（Firmicutes）的相对丰度显著高于非反应者。\",\n              \"reference_ids\": [\n                \"R11\"\n              ],\n              \"use_in_review\": \"作为背景研究，展示早期单队列研究中发现的特定菌种关联，用于对比说明当前研究中观察到的不一致性和缺乏共识的现象。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"attribution\": \"Gopalakrishnan et al. (2018)\",\n              \"conditions\": \"针对黑色素瘤患者抗PD-1免疫疗法反应的研究；使用宏基因组测序分析肠道微生物组。\",\n              \"finding\": \"发现ICI反应者中Faecalibacterium prausnitzii的相对丰度高于非反应者。\",\n              \"reference_ids\": [\n                \"R6\"\n              ],\n              \"use_in_review\": \"作为背景研究，展示另一项早期独立研究发现的不同菌种关联，进一步佐证不同研究间结果的差异性。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"attribution\": \"Matson et al. (2018)\",\n              \"conditions\": \"针对转移性黑色素瘤患者抗PD-1疗法反应的研究；关注共生微生物组。\",\n              \"finding\": \"发现PD-1治疗的反应性由一组八个物种的增加定义，主要由Bifidobacterium longum驱动。\",\n              \"reference_ids\": [\n                \"R5\"\n              ],\n              \"use_in_review\": \"作为背景研究，展示第三项独立研究发现的菌种组合关联，强调人类环境中缺乏统一共识的现状。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"attribution\": \"Frankel et al. (2017)\",\n              \"conditions\": \"针对黑色素瘤患者的宏基因组鸟枪法和代谢组学分析；关注不同ICI方案下的微生物组和代谢物。\",\n              \"finding\": \"报告微生物组因ICI治疗方案而异，但在接受任何ICI方案的反应者中，Bacteroides caccae的富集是常见的。\",\n              \"reference_ids\": [\n                \"R12\"\n              ],\n              \"use_in_review\": \"作为背景研究，展示微生物组差异可能取决于ICI治疗方案，并指出某些菌种（如Bacteroides caccae）在不同方案中普遍富集，但同样未形成跨研究的通用标志物。\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"explanation\": \"跨队列黑色素瘤研究中‘无通用标志物’的统计依据主要源于巨大的队列间异质性。首先，PERMANOVA分析证实“队列”本身是解释微生物群落组成变异的最大因素，其影响远超临床或人口统计学变量。其次，机器学习模型的跨队列泛化能力极差，内部验证表现尚可但外部验证（跨队列测试）的AUC-ROC值普遍较低且波动大，表明基于特定队列训练的微生物特征无法可靠地预测其他队列的反应。最后，尽管荟萃分析能识别出一些在多个队列中趋势一致的物种（如Roseburia spp.、Akkermansia muciniphila），但没有任何单一物种在所有数据集中达到统计学显著性并成为普适性生物标志物。这种不一致性被归因于人群特异性特征、样本处理和分析的方法学选择、饮食和药物使用的差异，以及微生物信号的功能相关性与队列内在特性。作者通过结直肠癌数据的对照分析排除了方法学缺陷的可能性，确认了黑色素瘤ICI反应中微生物关联的复杂性和队列依赖性。\",\n          \"question_id\": \"Q01\",\n          \"remaining_points\": [\n            \"具体哪些临床协变量（如PPI使用、既往治疗）在多大程度上介导了队列间的微生物差异及其对ICI反应的混淆作用，虽有提及但未深入量化其交互机制。\",\n            \"菌株水平的特异性如何具体影响跨队列的一致性，文中提到需要数千人的样本量来解析菌株多样性，但未提供具体的菌株水平跨队列分析数据。\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e7b396e8ca2b15ce24520d38\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b9fc85447d40b5e1f5713717\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0478\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"deep_read_material\",\n          \"paper_title\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Cross-cohort gut microbiome associations with immune checkpoint inhibitor response in advanced melanoma\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e7b396e8ca2b15ce24520d38\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::325a920b2c0f74180c22ca25\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0478\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"deep_read_material\",\n          \"plain_text\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e7b396e8ca2b15ce24520d38\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2381bccf6ef468f3ea8febc7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0478\",\n        \"field_path\": [\